model r3_reach
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.7, R3's reach (#142), from L §4.4 alone: each operation gives the interval of its values over the days its arguments can take, one value when the ends agree, and only a comparison decides an interval. Features no item of R3 names: year_of of a window (y_in one year, y_across two: a hole where one value is needed), and max of a window and a day, decided where every day agrees (m_after true, m_inside false)"

source card "T's card (invented)"

input w_in: date

input w_across: date

input d_after: date

input d_inside: date

def y_in: year = year_of(w_in)

def y_across: year = year_of(w_across)

def m_after: bool = max(w_in, d_after) == d_after

def m_inside: bool = max(w_in, d_inside) > d_after

ask y: y_in

ask y_hole: y_across

ask m: m_after

ask m_false: m_inside

version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  w_in = window(2026-06-01, 2026-06-30) "June"
  w_across = window(2026-12-20, 2027-01-10) "around the new year"
  d_after = 2026-07-15 "after the window"
  d_inside = 2026-06-15 "inside the window"
